$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Newman, Stephen G.; Bryan, Christopher S.; Perez, Didier; Lautens, Mark
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2011), (2), 342-346

